</div>

<h2 style="color:#d84315;font-size:2em;margin-top:40px;text-align:center;">2. Map Homestead Work to Real Academic Learning</h2>
<p>The strongest documentation connects <strong>what the student did</strong> with <strong>what the student studied, measured, calculated, researched, wrote, designed, tested, or evaluated</strong>.</p>

